{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_st02","storyGroup":"act46side","storySort":10,"storyDependence":"act46side_level_act46side_04_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OS-ST-2","storyName":"圣巡与丧钟","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"菈塔托丝的葬礼如期举行，休露丝承起家族的重担，三族关系缓和。恩希欧迪斯受到了来自开斯特公爵的施压。恩雅再度动身继续圣巡，寻找耶拉冈德消失的真相。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act46side/level_act46side_st02","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act46side_st02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":8,"next":10,"characters":["恩雅","茱安娜","布朗陶男贵族","布朗陶女贵族","休露丝","尤卡坦","阿克托斯","角峰","布朗陶佣人","蔓珠院使者","恩希欧迪斯","锏"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E7/Avg_bg_24_g12_mountpath.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"wind","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14side/m_sys_kjerag_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blizzard","layer":"1","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"枯瘦的树枝覆上一层白雪，裂云兽窜上枯枝前端，挤着双眼，一副严肃探查的模样。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"圣女轻声叹息，她停下脚步回头望去，身后不远处紧跟着她的猎手一怔，脸颊被风刮得泛红。","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","duration":"0.7","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"茱安娜......你不必跟着我。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"你所做的一切，我感激不尽。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"但是，我出发前也和你说过，“圣巡”必须独身一人完成，甚至与你对话已经是破例。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我知道。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我没有跟着您，不是您的护卫和侍从，我只是恰好和您同路。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"放心，我不会和您说话，要是有人看到我们，我就装作不认识您。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我绝对不会再让您陷入那样的危险的，我就一直在您后面跟着您。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"那茱安娜知道我要去哪里吗？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"您去哪里我都要跟着，我知道这个就行了。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"但......我要去找耶拉冈德。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"啊？","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"找祂......祂消失了吗？！","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0D/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"我不知道......但除非祂能再临，否则谢拉格还会面临像上次那般的灾厄。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"到那时候，有人会失去生命，更多的人会失去信念......","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"现在，我要先回到蔓珠院，在典籍中寻找新的方向，这一点要先瞒着其他人。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"那我也要跟着您，您放心，要是有人发现了您的踪迹，我就帮您赶走——","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#11$2","focus":"n","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"“咕噜咕噜”——","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"裂云兽好像发现了什么。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"往裂云兽的方向看去，远处前往蔓珠院的山道上挤满了穿着黯淡的人。","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"这是......有重要的人去世了。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"那会是谁？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0D/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"charslot","id":54},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅摇摇头。不安的寒意透过厚厚的行装，让她不禁打了个冷战。","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"恩雅，你还好吗？","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......我们慢点走，避开人群。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"wind","fadetime":"2","id":64},{"type":"bgeffect","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_bg_24_g2_temple_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":68},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":69,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"墨灰相交的云层低垂，直压寺院的瓦檐。今日的谢拉格尤为寒冷，北风几乎能灌进哀悼者的眼眶和骨髓。","id":72},{"type":"text","text":"聚在庭院里的家族成员与修士们默默低头，布朗陶的领民也自发围在院外，这位以生命守护谢拉格的家主，让他们骄傲，也让他们悲恸。","id":73},{"type":"text","text":"大雪随风飘来，积在一杆杆黑伞之上。伞柄稍一抖动，雪花如瀑落下，而伞下的布朗陶贵族也长叹了一口气。","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_272_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶男贵族","text":"所以，大夫人的遗体......","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_274_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶女贵族","text":"火势太凶，他们把残骸翻了个遍，一无所获。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_274_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶女贵族","text":"我听说，今天棺材里放着的，是她平日里的常服，以及一点从现场取得的灰烬。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_272_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶男贵族","text":"是吗？没料到大夫人一世精明，竟然——","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":82},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_272_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶男贵族","text":"啊，二夫人......","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶男贵族","text":"......对不起，是我失言了。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"......","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":93},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"2","id":94},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"休露丝不作回应，她径直走向庭院中间，等待着曾与自己朝夕相处的姐姐。","id":97},{"type":"text","text":"清脆的摇铃震颤，与婉转的笛子协奏。修士合上双手，低吟着赞美耶拉冈德的雅颂，领民随着歌声抚胸祈祷——","id":98},{"type":"text","text":"耶拉冈德垂怜，让她与您同行。","id":99},{"type":"text","text":"踏着泥泞的道路上山而来的，是六名布朗陶宗家的亲属，尤卡坦排在最前。他们缓步向前，厚实的楠木灵柩在他们的肩上起伏。","id":100},{"type":"text","text":"六人停在了布朗陶的继任者面前，小心翼翼地将灵柩放在一张桌台上。","id":101},{"type":"text","text":"尤卡坦踱步回到妻子的身边，他那悲戚不已的神色，正对着休露丝平静的面庞。","id":102},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","focus":"all","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_263_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw","id":107},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"nw","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"尤卡坦......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_263_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤卡坦","text":"露丝，我......","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_avg_npc_263_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"辛苦你了。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"颂歌唱罢，万籁渐息，众人一同注视着休露丝。","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"她第一次理解菈塔托丝那不得不佩戴的面具，责任的重量，绝非软弱者的肩背可以担负。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"......","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"感谢大家来到这里，与我一同悼念，菈塔托丝·布朗陶夫人。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"她不仅仅是我的姐姐，是布朗陶家的卫士，也是耶拉冈德忠实的孩子......","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"智慧为她带来勇气，她曾对我说，她会保护我和这里的一切......最艰难的日子里，她依然相信谢拉格会有充满希望的明天。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"于她而言，她没有辜负祖父的嘱托，在生命的最后一刻都在为布朗陶而奉献，至死不渝。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"于我而言......我失去了最重要的亲人，直到今天才如梦初醒般体会到她所有的苦衷，却再也不能向她诉说。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"相信在场的人都会和我一样，铭记她的音容、她的牺牲、她对谢拉格和布朗陶......对家人的，深沉的爱。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"......相信各位也会和我一样铭记在心——是谁破坏了美好，是谁给我们烙下无法愈合的伤痕。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"“短暂的一生如昼将尽，终在永恒之所与祂同行”......","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"耶拉冈德在上。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"charslot","id":133},{"type":"text","text":"“耶拉冈德在上”，此起彼伏。众人随着休露丝，一同行起跪礼。","id":134},{"type":"text","text":"在灾厄席卷一切的时代，耶拉冈德仍会给予每一个谢拉格人平和、安谧......","id":135},{"type":"text","text":"当所有人起身后，两人从人群中走出——阿克托斯与角峰，他们抱着洁白的花束，缓缓迈向灵柩。","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"节哀，休露丝......","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"菈塔托丝因我而死，我永远不会忘！","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AB/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"谢谢你，阿克托斯。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"我只希望这对于我们两家来说都是一个残酷的教训，我们都该搞清楚，谁才是真正的敌人。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"我......","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#10$1","duration":"0.7","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"休露丝大人......","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"恩希欧迪斯大人为不能出席仪式而愧疚，派我前来表达歉意与哀思，他会在合适的时间亲自登门问候。节哀顺变，休露丝大人。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"那家伙忙到这个地步了？","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"谢谢，我能理解，恩希欧迪斯为谢拉格付出的心血，布朗陶家始终看在眼里。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"......继续仪式吧，我想，今天二位都有话想对我说。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"bgeffect","id":164},{"type":"charslot","id":165},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_bg_24_g8_nobleroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":167},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":168,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":170},{"type":"text","text":"尘埃落定，众人离去，没有遗体的灵柩埋于布朗陶家的土地，葬在疼爱她的祖父的身边。","id":171},{"type":"text","text":"休露丝抿起嘴唇，注视着面前的两个男人——他们的脸上都带着怒气。","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"阿克托斯大人，我只是在重申上一次三族议会最终的结论：包括维多利亚在内，一切对外事宜皆由恩希欧迪斯大人和希瓦艾什负责。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"这就是你悍然索要维多利亚间谍的理由？","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"公然谋害布朗陶家主如此大事，希瓦艾什若想单独审问，我第一个不答应。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"角峰先生，间谍谋害的是布朗陶家主，关于他们，我希望能由布朗陶家全权决定。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"请问恩希欧迪斯对此有什么不满吗？","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"言重了。以谢拉格的历史惯例，维持三族议会的结论是一个原则性问题，由希瓦艾什处理间谍是符合程序与理性的选择。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"我们已经忍让希瓦艾什够多了，角峰。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"和维多利亚人的谈判一问你们就是满嘴搪塞，到现在也没个结果，反倒是让这帮人在光天化日之下实施恐怖袭击。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"你们到底对维多利亚人是个什么态度，背后到底计划着什么，让恩希欧迪斯当着休露丝的面解释清楚了，再谈间谍的事也不迟。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"阿克托斯大人......请您停止无端的猜测，我已经非常克制了。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"被袭击的不只是您和菈塔托丝大人，我们恩希亚小姐也险遭不幸，我只恨没能亲自抓捕袭击者。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"好啊，既然你也这么想，那就好办了。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"全体谢拉格人公审那几个维多利亚佬，再由布朗陶家出人亲手处决。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"让整片大地都知道，我们对谢拉格的敌人绝不手软。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"......太鲁莽了！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"......","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"我们之前审过一轮，他们的嘴非常严，即便是公审也得不到什么结果。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"反而我很担心，他们会在公审途中说出什么妖言惑众的话来，谢拉格如今人心飘摇，不能冒这个风险。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"装哑巴还不老实？那就拔了舌头，该怎么弄就怎么弄。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"刚才葬礼上，就该好好告慰菈塔托丝，把他们拎出来直接毙了！","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"阿克托斯......我也和你一样，想为姐姐复仇，但目前还有套出情报的可能，不能任着性子动手。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"休露丝大人说得没错，还是由——","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_268","duration":"1","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶佣人","text":"三位大人，抱歉打扰了，这位蔓珠院派来的修士有要事商议。","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"......上一次“蔓珠院派来的人”导致阿克托斯和恩希亚遭到刺杀。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"我应该如何确认你的身份，修士？","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"不必多虑，阿克托斯大人认得我。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"不错，休露丝，这位确实是蔓珠院的弗雷修士。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"那么，修士有什么事情要与我们商量呢？","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"我为维多利亚间谍而来。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"？！","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"蔓珠院认为，这些人关系重大，单单交由三大家族哪一方处置都会遭到非议，难以服众。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"所以，间谍应该由蔓珠院暂为看管，酌情安排审讯，到时候蔓珠院将知会各位，共同参与。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"我不同意，迟早都要杀，有什么可拖延的？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"修士，你不能这么做，三族议会已经决定由希瓦艾什负责维多利亚事务了。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"m","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"三族议会也已决定归权还政，还需要我提醒你吗？","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"如今圣女大人还在进行圣巡，蔓珠院不能代她决定！","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"恩希欧迪斯大人向来对我们阳奉阴违，这时候倒想起圣女大人来了？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"谢拉格人都该清楚，历史上圣女大人与蔓珠院始终同心同德，这是古今一辙、写进经书的事实。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"过往圣女大人不在时，也是由蔓珠院代行职责。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"请转告恩希欧迪斯大人，不管在任何时候，都不要妄想自己能独揽大权。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"修士——","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"角峰先生，不要激动。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"......","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"布朗陶家同意履行要求，烦请修士明日差人前来，将间谍押送蔓珠院。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"休露丝？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"我理解你们二位的善意，但现在比以往更需要放下三方争执......蔓珠院能够从中协调，再好不过了。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"二夫人雅量，蔓珠院会为布朗陶祈福的。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院使者","text":"耶拉冈德在上。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"text","text":"休露丝欠身，向蔓珠院的使者行礼。","id":264},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_67_G4_kjeragstreet.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.08","fadetime":"0.1","id":270},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.08","fadetime":"0.1","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":272},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":274},{"type":"text","text":"日过正午，送葬的队伍渐渐散去。","id":275},{"type":"text","text":"不远处，停在街角的轿车内，一位乘客目睹这场结局后，将车帘缓缓拉上。","id":276},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......看起来，有人已经沉不住气了。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"圣女离开后，蔓珠院内部的动作越来越多了。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"我意外的是，菈塔托丝能做到这个份上。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"引出维多利亚间谍，却以自己为饵。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"足够宏大的一幕，能让更多人看到维多利亚的行为。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"另一方面，既然维多利亚人试图点燃她与其他各家的战火，那么她独自承受结果，也是为布朗陶家洗脱嫌疑的最高效方法。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"但是还不够......我们要把握菈塔托丝争取来的宝贵时机。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"......你为什么不亲自参加菈塔托丝的葬礼？","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......我应该要避免和其他族长的直接冲突，尤其是在公开场合。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"所以，恩雅那边......","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"她受了轻伤，没有大碍，维多利亚的刺客也悉数解决了。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"恩雅说，她有一个需要隐秘执行的新计划。清理完我们留下的痕迹后，她便劝说我回来。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"人们只知道圣女在圣巡，维多利亚人也只知道刺杀计划的失败，一切线索通通断在雪山之中。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"若想隐藏行踪，让名闻遐迩的黑骑士继续跟着自己，确实不是一个好主意。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"我同样如此判断。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......也好，接下来，我的身边非常需要能够信任的人。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"真正的麻烦，还是来了。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wadmoney","volume":"1","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":310},{"type":"text","text":"恩希欧迪斯从怀里抽出一个文件袋，锏接了过来——里面是一沓厚厚的协议，还夹着一封用维多利亚语写的信件。","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"打开看看。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"谁写的？信？","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"嗯......","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"更像是一封战书。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"curtain","id":325},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":330},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$lab_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_sys_lab_loop.mp3","volume":"0.4","id":331,"musicid":3},{"type":"sticker","id":332,"multi":"true","text":"致喀兰贸易董事长、我的族女伊丽莎白之子——","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":333,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n恩希欧迪斯·希瓦艾什","x":"380","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":334,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n展信安。自宴会相见后，已过十余年了。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":335,"multi":"true","text":"\\n或许你听闻维多利亚的大事时，也会像我一样回忆起当初的对话。你预言了我近年经历的纷争，也已经争取到了与维多利亚平视的资格。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":336,"multi":"true","text":"\\n但不要忘记，你所走出的每一步道路，同样都是维多利亚愿意看到，并为你而铺设的。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":337},{"type":"sticker","id":338,"multi":"true","text":"天灾降临后，维多利亚的立场依然不变，我们乐见谢拉格的发展，敬重谢拉格的信仰。我也相信，希瓦艾什与谢拉格，没有任何时刻比当下更需要帮助。","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":339,"multi":"true","text":"\\n而我，会向你伸出援手。","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":340,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n......","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":341},{"type":"sticker","id":342,"multi":"true","text":"关于现在与喀兰贸易的合作，我可以接受如下提议：由我们双方共同出资、管理、组建特别办事处，并在城市中心建立相关基金会实体。","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":343,"multi":"true","text":"\\n维多利亚不但会在旧例的基础上加码，以提供设备和无息贷款的形式向谢拉格注资，还可以共享更多的工业技术，以支持谢拉格未来的发展。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":344},{"type":"sticker","id":345,"multi":"true","text":"相对的，谢拉格只需让维多利亚参与本地未来矿区开发，包括但不限于源石矿产，以此作为贷款偿还项目。","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":346,"multi":"true","text":"\\n从始至终，不需要喀兰贸易提供任何现金，毕竟以谢拉格的现状而言，需要资金的地方还有很多。我想，这应该足以体现诚意。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":347},{"type":"sticker","id":348,"multi":"true","text":"协议的具体文本，我已经整理成册。查看无误后，你可以直接签字确认。","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":349,"multi":"true","text":"\\n如若还有细节需要推敲，我会亲自与你面谈。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":350},{"type":"sticker","id":351,"multi":"true","text":"我很期待，开斯特家族的血脉，会为我们带来何种连结？","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":352,"multi":"true","text":"\\n我也愈发好奇，如今的谢拉格，是否成为了如你所想的模样？","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":353,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n......","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"image","id":360}],"characters":["恩雅","茱安娜","布朗陶男贵族","布朗陶女贵族","休露丝","尤卡坦","阿克托斯","角峰","布朗陶佣人","蔓珠院使者","恩希欧迪斯","锏"]}